    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "strength? what strength is there in standing amidst the ashes? every time i try to find a \"path to dawn\" it just leads me to more loss. i'm not looking for a way to keep fighting anymore. i just want the noise to stop. i feel like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming.",
